Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> statements
Rule 2     statements -> statements statement
Rule 3     statements -> statement
Rule 4     statement -> NAME EQUALS expression
Rule 5     statement -> LIN LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 6     statement -> WAIT LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 7     statement -> WAIT_MOTION LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 8     statement -> FOR LPAREN statement COMMA expression COMMA statement RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
Rule 9     statement -> SET_REG LPAREN expression COMMA expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 10    statement -> expression
Rule 11    expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 12    expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 13    expression -> expression TIMES expression
Rule 14    expression -> expression DIVIDE expression
Rule 15    expression -> expression LT expression
Rule 16    expression -> expression GT expression
Rule 17    expression -> expression EQ expression
Rule 18    expression -> expression NE expression
Rule 19    expression -> expression LE expression
Rule 20    expression -> expression GE expression
Rule 21    expression -> MINUS expression
Rule 22    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 23    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 24    expression -> NAME

Terminals, with rules where they appear

COMMA                : 5 8 8 9 9
DIVIDE               : 14
EQ                   : 17
EQUALS               : 4
FOR                  : 8
GE                   : 20
GT                   : 16
LBRACE               : 8
LE                   : 19
LIN                  : 5
LPAREN               : 5 6 7 8 9 22
LT                   : 15
MINUS                : 12 21
NAME                 : 4 24
NE                   : 18
NUMBER               : 23
PLUS                 : 11
RBRACE               : 8
RPAREN               : 5 6 7 8 9 22
SET_REG              : 9
TIMES                : 13
WAIT                 : 6
WAIT_MOTION          : 7
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

expression           : 4 5 5 6 8 9 9 9 10 11 11 12 12 13 13 14 14 15 15 16 16 17 17 18 18 19 19 20 20 21 22
program              : 0
statement            : 2 3 8 8
statements           : 1 2 8

